        "name": "白萝卜",
        "desc": "纤维分明的草本植物。易于种植与收获的作物，富含纤维与营养。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Radish_icon.png",
        "amount": 3,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4006,
        "name": "茉洁草",
        "desc": "<p>华润而温莹的桃色花朵。拥有不同层次的芬芳，是用来调香的主要原料之一。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/05/88072335/946e456e7b8f19211bdb36ab65ab0a23_9206363963951935211.png",
